4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=By-KxKjLSSkQ7kNvwFL71BO&_nc_oc=Adp1Ri__j1tWK985xPVGFmJt4loTnbXg_IrVfJGj-FJqZejkyGsuzGTrsBxfTMiGaMs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9p4nHF8PJqtQTONGtIJRl7BmKSzd3_ujSnrDDP4pPYVQ&oe=6A2C03D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V5sZK-xHbjMQ7kNvwFNrfZ4&_nc_oc=Adqf6CEBR1srq0Z9VrcER1zYlVSEq5nl0Edb2Kd8DS3RzCNrC9-OVOOp4OMcLrHHHc8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_pZToDPjbI6Jg7_5rSJKi_qOOnhn70DTL-G8VUvOmnPA&oe=6A2C08B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mC7kdZozQ08Q7kNvwHeZXQh&_nc_oc=Adobnl8X_Kf_wi-L8IvMi_xdzEXawaeHdElXuPLKauDGTsDMwJAHOg-UVbdZfvQ4MVo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-jwGi-GY3CL8P37decf0EI9zoOlOl4PFqbOgPBgPho5g&oe=6A2C1655"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p